; Which price convert() uses: the date asked, none given, and the ties.
2026-01-01 open Assets:Dated
2026-01-01 open Assets:SameDay
2026-01-01 open Assets:DirectFirst
2026-01-01 open Assets:InverseFirst
2026-01-01 open Assets:Mixed
2026-01-01 open Equity:Other

; a history, with one price far in the future
2026-01-10 price AAA 1 EUR
2026-02-10 price AAA 2 EUR
2026-03-10 price AAA 3 EUR
2099-01-01 price AAA 9 EUR

; two prices of one pair on one day: the one written last
2026-02-01 price BBB 2 EUR
2026-02-01 price BBB 3 EUR

; a price and the inverse price on one day: the one written last, whichever way it points
2026-02-01 price CCC 2 EUR
2026-02-01 price EUR 4 CCC
2026-02-01 price EUR 4 DDD
2026-02-01 price DDD 2 EUR

; the pair seen both ways on different days: the latest, whichever way it points
2026-02-03 price EEE 3 EUR
2026-02-04 price EUR 0.1 EEE
2026-02-05 price EEE 5 EUR
; written below a later date
2026-02-02 price EEE 7 EUR

2026-01-02 * "hold ten of each"
  Assets:Dated        10 AAA
  Assets:SameDay      10 BBB
  Assets:DirectFirst  10 CCC
  Assets:InverseFirst 10 DDD
  Assets:Mixed        10 EEE
  Equity:Other       -10 AAA
  Equity:Other       -10 BBB
  Equity:Other       -10 CCC
  Equity:Other       -10 DDD
  Equity:Other       -10 EEE
